{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act42side_level_act42side_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act42side",
  "stageId": "act42side_02",
  "title": "祈禱",
  "storyCode": "MT-2",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act42side/level_act42side_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "68ccd9b037e38abd201f896e6f6ff2249538bf376c47916ce18027a12cdc6281",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "法柏爾區，博爾戈街，銃械工坊"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "……你好，有人在嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "這間工坊不大，充當貨架的聖徒像隨意陳列，它們以各種匪夷所思的姿勢向客人展示著銃械……\n但阿摩斯並未看到一個客人，他一路走來，除了自己，並沒有什麼人在工坊的門前停留。“冷清”——這是阿摩斯最初的感受。\n也不至於連老闆都不見蹤影吧？他看著昏暗的燈光打在那些聖徒像上，心想。“詭異”——這是阿摩斯隨後的感受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "潘格尼尼先生在嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "（說真的，為什麼銃械工坊的老闆要叫這麼滑稽的名字……）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿摩斯四處觀察，突然撞到了什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他猛然回頭，對上了一雙碩大而透亮的眼睛，那眼睛隱藏在陰影中，直直地盯著他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大眼睛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "救……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大眼睛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "*拉特蘭俚語*你是誰啊亂闖我的地盤——等我戴個眼鏡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大眼睛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "公務員？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大眼睛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "抱歉啊，最近也沒生意，躲在裡面睡覺，沒想到會有公務員先生大駕光臨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "樞機輔佐官阿摩斯，來確認這間銃械工坊的接收事宜。您就是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "我就是名字很滑稽的潘格尼尼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "等等，黎博利？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "難不成我看起來像薩科塔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "啊抱歉，我的意思是，我沒見過黎博利從事這個職業。畢竟，守護銃只有薩科塔——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "有什麼問題？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "很多廚師都不吃自己做的菜，我只是無法使用自己製造的武器罷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "你要檢查我的銃械製造資格證明嗎？放眼整個拉特蘭，出自我手中的守護銃沒有一千也有八百，說不定你手上的這把……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "嘖嘖，一看做工就很“頂級”，我倒是沒這樣的手藝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "不過如今都無所謂了，反正這裡就要關閉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "近期所有的訂單都已經退掉了，店裡新完工的這一批銃，到時候讓公證所的人直接帶走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "原、原來您已經做好準備了，我本來還以為……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "會很麻煩？我這個人會很難搞？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "我、我不是這個意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "註冊資料顯示，這間銃械工坊已經有百年的歷史了。身為黎博利，您卻選擇為薩科塔製造守護銃，這裡對您來說一定意義非凡——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "好了好了。這幾年來誰都知道銃械工坊要成為歷史了，大家都只是在等那個時候到來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "你問我願不願意，我當然不願意。需要我把最近這段時間徹夜難眠的煎熬過程傾訴給你聽嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "如果您需要傾訴，我可以幫您攔一輛告解車，告解費由七廳承擔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "那恐怕還是你更需要告解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "我已經是個要退休的老頭了，但梵里妮，我的學徒，她甚至還來不及親手為自己做一把守護銃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "既然銃械工坊將不復存在，你們得負責那個孩子後續的發展。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "當然，銃械工坊的關閉，只是為了讓銃械生產的流程變得更符合規定、效率更高。像您與您的學徒這樣的銃械工匠，仍是寶貴的人才。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "我會向負責民政的第六廳彙報。您的學徒——梵里妮小姐，應該會被推薦到米迦萊昂區即將落成的製銃聖堂工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "“製銃聖堂”……嘖。但願他們開工製銃的那天，還能像取這個名字的時候那麼自信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "我當然相信拉特蘭的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "好了好了，這種鬼話我聽得夠多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "……那麼，如果沒有別的問題，請您在這份停業文件上簽名吧，潘格尼尼先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "即刻起，此銃械工坊的所有業務都將終止，後續會由中庭公證所跟進具體的接收事宜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "text": "那麼，再見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "不送。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "text": "法柏爾區，博爾戈街……真是熟悉啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "text": "哈哈，就是這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯珀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_696_1",
      "text": "終於完成接駁了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "庫蘭塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "應、應該吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "庫蘭塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "在外圍等了兩天，我想快點出去透透氣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "text": "真是的，是這群拉特蘭人在我們流浪的時候邀請我們登上了這座移動修道院，結果到了拉特蘭又讓我們在這裡乾等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "text": "讓各位久等了，非常抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "text": "在此之前，已經有十二座移動修道院陸續抵達了拉特蘭，加上萬國峰會期間事務繁多，希望各位理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "text": "公證所已在安布羅修區準備了短期的安置住宅，等到各位安頓下來，第六廳將協助各位辦理戶籍和社會福利事宜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯珀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_696_1",
      "text": "等、等等，修女，沒理解錯的話，我們這些外族人以後可以定居在拉特蘭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "text": "以第二屆萬國峰會為契機，拉特蘭將向所有種族敞開懷抱……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "text": "這裡也將成為“你們的城市”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂喂，添頭，你還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我請人去找醫生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "暫時別讓那群薩科塔發現……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "text": "請讓我過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "庫蘭塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "修女，不用了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "text": "我們能處理，你剛剛不是說還有很多事情要忙嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1807_1",
      "text": "嘶——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "text": "薩卡茲……你懷孕了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1807_1",
      "text": "你們的人邀請大家進修道院的時候並沒有攔著薩卡茲，怎樣，現在又想拿來做文章？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1807_1",
      "text": "我可以馬上走，我不稀罕薩科塔的幫助！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1807_1",
      "text": "所以你們也別想對付我和我的孩子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "各位誤會了，只是修道院的一般對接事務中並不包含如何安置一位懷孕的母親，安吉修女一下子沒有反應過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "安吉修女，請允許我將她帶回育嬰聖堂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "text": "閣下，育嬰聖堂還未正式對外開放，這不符合規定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "text": "以及，您怎麼在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "text": "主遣我至應至之地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "text": "規定只是死物。育嬰聖堂不可能無視一位病重的母親。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "text": "我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1807_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "text": "女士，我叫歧法，拉特蘭育嬰聖堂的牧首，唔，也就是負責人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "金髮女性緩緩轉向薩卡茲，她的聲音很輕柔，卻又足夠清晰，像是在小心翼翼地試探著什麼。\n薩卡茲的視線劃過她頭頂那兩對漆黑的尖角，落在她的眼睛上。透過眼罩繁複的雕紋，她看到了一片虛無。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1807_1",
      "text": "你是什麼……薩卡茲，還是薩科塔？而且還是個瞎子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "text": "薩卡茲、薩科塔，這些詞語本不必被用於強調區別。我與你何其相似……我也跟你一樣，在撫育著我所珍視的生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "text": "所以，目盲並不妨礙我感受你和你腹中的新生命……他給你帶來了怎樣的緊張與喜悅啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1807_1",
      "text": "我們薩卡茲從來不這麼說話。所以你是薩科塔，是個有小孩的奇怪薩科塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1807_1",
      "text": "你就是在剛剛說的那個育什麼堂，撫育你的小孩的嗎？那到底是什麼地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "text": "“育嬰聖堂”，你我此刻正站在它的蔭庇之中。新生命在那裡誕下，得到撫育。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1807_1",
      "text": "一座“聖堂”……專門用來生小孩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "text": "新生是神聖的。每一次新生，都是對拉特蘭信仰的延續。唯有如此，我們才得以塑造未來的形貌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1807_1",
      "text": "聽不懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "text": "女士，你一直在荒野上流浪，孕期沒有得到應有的照顧，你現在非常虛弱……他也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "text": "你確定要在這個時候離開近在咫尺的聖城，重回荒野？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1807_1",
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "text": "女士，你的名字叫“添頭”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1807_1",
      "text": "不好聽？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "text": "我們知曉薩卡茲的困頓與艱難……許多薩卡茲母親會隨口將孩子取名為“添頭”，只把孩子視作自己生活中的一個小小的添頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1807_1",
      "text": "這個名字跟我媽沒關係，是我懷了這孩子之後，自己取的。誰能說清楚我和這孩子，到底誰是誰的添頭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "text": "啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1807_1",
      "text": "有什麼問題嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "text": "……你很看重自己與這個孩子的聯繫。你驕傲地希望讓所有人都知道，你的生活裡多出了這樣一個小小的添頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "text": "女士，這樣偉大的情感，無關乎種族與仇恨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1807_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "text": "我明白你在擔心什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "text": "此刻，這座修道院中的所有人——薩科塔、菲林、庫蘭塔、魯珀、沃爾珀……所有人都是你我的見證。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "text": "請放心，現在是萬國峰會期間，無數異族的來客齊聚拉特蘭，拉特蘭還不至於在所有人都知情的情況下對一個懷孕的母親做什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_418_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "庫蘭塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "（點頭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魯珀",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_696_1",
      "text": "（傳遞眼神）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_369_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "text": "我向你保證。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "添頭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1807_1",
      "text": "那好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "text": "感謝你的理解，女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "text": "讓我們共同迎接這個即將在拉特蘭降生的新生命，他將跨越隔閡，被賦予全新的意義，這次孕育將成為一次壯舉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "text": "我為此而來……主遣我至應至之地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧首",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1777_1",
      "text": "最後，歡迎來到拉特蘭……如今的拉特蘭需要各位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "反正我幫不了你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "text": "哎呀，我還什麼都沒說呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "那請問，這位薩科塔小姐，你是要維修守護銃還是要訂製彈藥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "出門往左，如果你的動作比那些公務員快，米迦萊昂區或許還剩下三四家銃械工坊沒有被關閉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "十分鐘前，我已經在第七廳的接收文書上簽名了，現在經手任何相關的事情都等於觸犯律法……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "text": "如果我說我想搞一場轟動全城的大爆炸呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "沒興趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "text": "拜託，你是“銃械工坊之王”潘大師啊！誰都能對爆炸不感興趣，但你不可以啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "……不要拿你剛編的稱號來恭維我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "text": "潘大師，我知道你的難處啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "text": "我也只是想請你幫點小忙而已——比如說借一下你這裡的設備，或者你的專業知識——幫我理解一下拉特蘭現在的情況。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "text": "畢竟我真的很著急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "text": "我的老闆說，無論發生什麼都不能阻礙企鵝物流完成任務然後辦派對！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "呃……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "text": "不需要您親手做任何事情，這樣就不算觸犯律法了，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "把你的守護銃從我的收藏上移開，薩科塔小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "尤其是，這把銃還*拉特蘭俚語*是我親手做的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "text": "哈哈，你認出來了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "text": "那你一定知道它的威力有多大吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "text": "老師，我找保拉醫生幫你重新配了一副眼鏡！她唸我唸了好久，說你要是再接著戴之前那副古董眼鏡，那簡直就是自虐……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "text": "快點戴上試試看吧。呃——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "text": "老師，這是怎麼回事？！這個人是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "text": "哎呀——這不是當初那個不太會說話的小妹妹嘛！什麼時候說話這麼流利了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "text": "你叫什麼啊？梵莉姆、梵妮斯，還是梵——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使&梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "text": "——梵里妮！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "text": "你看，我們的默契還在的嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "text": "啊……我想起來了，小樂姐！你當時來工坊選自己的第一把守護銃……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "text": "每次店裡有客人來，老師都不讓我出去打擾客人……可是那天外面動靜真的很大，我實在忍不住好奇……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "text": "結果還是被老師發現了。我一直在害怕挨駡，其他的事情都記不太清楚了……對不起，小樂姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "text": "是這樣嗎？你當時在害怕嗎……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "text": "（點頭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "text": "奇怪，我以為你當時很開心的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "text": "對了，小樂姐，你今天來工坊，是為了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_1041_angel2_1",
      "text": "（眨眼睛）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "梵妮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘格尼尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1781_1",
      "text": "剛剛第七廳的人來過了，這間工坊已經……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "text": "我還沒有成為正式的製銃師，不算這間工坊的員工，應該不算觸犯律法吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梵里妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1779_1",
      "text": "老師，讓我來接待這位客人可以嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倔強的小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1801_1",
      "text": "保育員先生，抓到你了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驕傲的小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1802_1",
      "text": "你跑到哪裡去了？洛米雅說你在躲我們，是真的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "text": "怎麼會呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倔強的小孩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1801_1",
      "text": "那我們一起去玩“光環遊戲”！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1802_1",
      "text": "今天由我來陪你們玩吧，安多恩叔叔還有事要做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "text": "薇爾麗芙閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "text": "我只是有點私事需要處理，很快就會回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1780_1",
      "text": "別緊張，你的暫離申請已經同步發給我了。倒是你自己，明明請了假，卻還在這裡陪孩子們玩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "text": "……只是一場“光環遊戲”的話，應該不會耽誤時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1780_1",
      "text": "然後呢？你覺得孩子們會乖乖放你走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "text": "……我會想辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1780_1",
      "text": "我聽到的說法是，你從來沒辦法拒絕孩子們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1780_1",
      "text": "因勤懇與虔誠而被牧首看重，並由她親手培養起來的第一位保育員……竟然曾經是違背律法的罪犯，誰能想到呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "text": "薇爾麗芙閣下，我確實只是去參加一個朋友的家庭聚會，我們許久未見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1780_1",
      "text": "都說了不用緊張，我並不擔心你在吹氣球或者烤蛋糕的時候會把拉特蘭炸掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1780_1",
      "text": "我只是好奇，為什麼牧首眼中的你，與教皇廳記錄中的你，像是兩個截然不同的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "text": "……牧首從未忽視或否認我的罪行，薇爾麗芙閣下。她只是更看重我對她的理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "text": "那時她還不是牧首，我只是在一座廢棄的移動修道院躲避天災時，恰巧與她相遇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "text": "牧首眼盲，聽覺卻非常敏銳。在源石浪潮衝擊遠方山脈的轟響之中，她聽到了從地下室傳來的一聲哀哭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "text": "一位母親，滿身血污地蜷縮在陰影中，奄奄一息。她試圖威嚇牧首，保護自己的孩子，卻只能做出痛苦的表情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1780_1",
      "text": "你和牧首最初帶來聖城的那位母親？她的傷是最有醫德的醫生也會放棄搶救的程度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1780_1",
      "text": "你們是如何判斷出她能活下來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "text": "我沒有……我起初甚至不相信她能活過那個晚上。但牧首相信奇蹟，彷彿那是天經地義之事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "text": "牧首想要讓我也相信，相信那位可憐的母親能因我們而得救。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "text": "她得救了，薇爾麗芙閣下……一開始，我並不擅長醫療護理的工作，只好盡我所能地感受她、陪伴她、照顧她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1780_1",
      "text": "你們在一座擱淺荒野的修道院裡滯留了三個月，就為了一個“奇蹟”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "text": "……因為拉特蘭需要一個奇蹟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1780_1",
      "text": "那你們還真是比我印象中要理性得多，或許我該對你們都刮目相看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安多恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1800_1",
      "text": "……如果這樣有助於教皇廳支持育嬰聖堂的工作內容的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1780_1",
      "text": "理性到有點無聊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1780_1",
      "text": "快去快回吧，安多恩保育員，至少我還希望看到降生儀式順利舉行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
